# ---- Source documents ----
# Working-reference documents from the real process. These carry proprietary and
# confidential content (legal entities, cost centers, CAGE codes, site locations,
# CAS/FAR disclosure classifications) and are sensitivity-labelled at source.
# They stay on disk as local reference and are never committed. Anything the repo
# needs from them is transcribed by hand, genericised, and reviewed first.
*.docx
*.doc
*.pptx
*.ppt
*.pdf

# ---- Build / misc ----
*.log
tmp/
.tmp/
